<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hutchison Whampoa cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hutchison Whampoa cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan said it reduced the rating on Hutchison Whampoa Ltd to market underperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- said container terminal profits &quot;appear to have been very weak&quot; in 1996, and &quot;property development sales were virtually absent&quot; from 1996 earnings.</p>
</text>
